        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Howl of Vengeful Fury"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, occult, sonic)\n\nFrequency: 1/hour\n\nThe red-hooded thatchling sobs pitifully before unleashing a terrifying scream. All non-thatchling creatures within a 30-foot emanation take 2d10 sonic damage (DC 18 basic Fortitude save) and become immune to all thatchlings' distracting giggle for 1 minute. Thatchlings in the area gain 5 temporary Hit Points and a +1 status bonus to their Strikes and saving throws for 1 minute."
            },
